    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shoot, dash, deflect, teleport through portals, and upgrade.</h2> Blast your way through challenging and unique bosses as you gain valuable upgrades in this short and sweet bullet hell top-down arena shooter.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Crazy Fun Boss Rush Arena Shooter</h2>Quantum Contours throws you into the arena to fight a merciless collection of bosses.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quantum Mechanics Based Skills and Weapons</h2>Use your quantum abilities to destroy your competition. Teleport with quantum tunneling, fire photons and neutrinos, and much more. Battle bosses based in the quantum realm, each with a surplus of unique attacks and abilities ready to try to take you out.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrades</h2>After the defeat of each boss, gain unique upgrades to aid you in this challenging, yet satisfying permadeath shooter.",
